{"answerArea":{"calculator":false,"chi2Table":false,"periodicTable":false,"tTable":false,"zTable":false},"hints":[{"content":"Let's simplify $\\blueD{4^2+2^2}$.\n\n\n$\\begin{align} \u0026\\phantom{=}\\blueD{4^2+2^2}\n \\\\\n\u0026={16 + 4} \\\\\n\u0026 = \\blueD{20} \\end{align}$\n","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}},{"content":"Now let's simplify $\\greenD{{6^2-6}}$.\n\n$\\begin{align} \u0026\\phantom{=}\\greenD{6^2-6}\n \\\\\n\u0026={36-6} \\\\\n\u0026 = \\greenD{30} \\end{align}$\n\n","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}},{"content":"And finally, $\\purpleD{5^2}=5\\cdot5 = \\purpleD{25}$.","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}},{"content":"Now we can order the expressions.\n\n$\\blueD{20}\u003c\\purpleD{25}\u003c\\greenD{30}$ \n\nSo, $\\blueD{4^2+2^2}\u003c\\purpleD{5^2}\u003c\\greenD{6^2-6}$.","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}},{"content":"The expressions from least to greatest are:  \n\n $4^2+2^2$  \n $5^2$  \n $6^2-6$\n","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}}],"itemDataVersion":{"major":0,"minor":1},"question":{"content":"**Order the expressions from least to greatest.**\n\n\n[[☃ sorter 1]]","images":{},"widgets":{"sorter 1":{"alignment":"default","graded":true,"options":{"correct":["$4^2+2^2$","$5^2$","$6^2-6$"],"layout":"horizontal","padding":true},"static":false,"type":"sorter","version":{"major":0,"minor":0}}}}}
